"You can override default Arduino Opta (M4 core) settings per build "
"environment using ``board_***`` option, where ``***`` is a JSON object path "
"from board manifest `opta_m4.json <https://github.com/platformio/platform-"
"ststm32/blob/master/boards/opta_m4.json>`_. For example, ``board_build."
